# Credentials and signing material: never commit them (Meridian keeps secrets in macOS Keychain).
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.p8
*.cer
*.mobileprovision
*.keystore
credentials*.json
client_secret*.json
token*.json
!extension/**/token*.json

